// 乐安（pxlean，州郡技能）：当你获得此技能后，你从牌堆获得一张属性【杀】和一张
// 【铁索连环】。
// 上游 (sp/skill.js:2098)：trigger player:changeSkillsAfter；filter = addSkill 含本技；
// forced；content = gain(cardPile2(属性杀) + cardPile2("tiesuo"))。
// 实现：skill_added + owner_skill_added_self_4240733007 → gain_card_by_kind(self,
// sha_fire)（属性杀以火杀近似）+ gain_card_by_kind(self, tiesuo)。
skill pxlean(4240733007) {
  trigger skill_added owner_skill_added_self_4240733007 {
    effect gain_card_by_kind(self, sha_fire);
    effect gain_card_by_kind(self, tiesuo);
  }
}
